WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.101 --> 00:00:06.988
By Jesus' time, Herod had transformed
Jerusalem's temple.

2
00:00:07.157 --> 00:00:09.438
Along the southern edge stood the Royal
Stoa,

3
00:00:09.453 --> 00:00:11.321
a great colonnaded hall.

4
00:00:13.168 --> 00:00:15.940
Our view follows ancient descriptions,

5
00:00:15.955 --> 00:00:18.582
with some details interpreted.

6
00:00:18.705 --> 00:00:21.708
Within the sanctuary, a lampstand, bread
table

7
00:00:21.723 --> 00:00:24.610
and incense altar furnished the Holy Place.

8
00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:30.906
Seven lamps burn on a single golden stand.

9
00:00:31.112 --> 00:00:32.801
Beyond the sanctuary lay the courts

10
00:00:32.816 --> 00:00:34.351
where Jesus walked and taught.

